    "palaeopen_alignment_rule": "PalaeOpen alignment fit is high when the lake already carries >=2 direct pollen sources and >=4 evidence families within 20 km",
    "warning": "This is a fieldwork-preparation surface, not a final sampling recommendation."
  },
